+|---------------|--------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|------------------|
+| EFO_0000274   | atopic&nbsp;eczema | A chronic inflammatory genetically determined disease of the skin ... | 0.66364347241831 |
+
+<br/><br/>
+
+**Get associated drugs for a specific gene:**   
